There are MUDS for those who feel that way also.  MUD is not the be-all, 
end-all of the world.  You can push new boundaries in RL too with RL 
consequences -- you can fall in love, you can get arrested, the bungee 
cord can snap from too many pork rinds.  What fantasies
are you speaking of?  Fantasies of the sexual nature?  Sure, you can have 
sex with that fido corpse.  Sure, you can make love to the tree.  But you 
better ask first :).  Sure, people can feel free and scream "Fire!" or 
take out their angst/rage on a poor cat.  They can also do it in the 
privacy of their own imaginations, but we humans are a gregarious sort.
We want some sort of unimagined interaction.  And if you can find other 
parties to partake in those fantasies that's great.  In my own experience,
RL is not too kind to the minorities such as me (it's better than in the 
50's and 60's but still there's always room for improvement).  Perhaps by 
something as small as "HELP PLUG" or "HELP RULES" I too am making a world 
for myself.  (cue the MLK speech and the John Williams' march)  Selfish 
ain't it?  

You can make a world for yourself too.  Just unpack the MERC or 
circle code and make up your own MUD.  (Fear a Nazi mud come up... or a 
Hugh Hefner MUD :) )

