webster: trying server at webster.lcs.mit.edu...connected.

Word: censor
Word: 
webster: Closing connection.
1. cen.sor \'sen(t)-s*r\ \sen-'so-r-e--*l, -'so.r-\ n [L, fr. cense-re to 
