If we can agree that we are discussing censorship in the context of
definition 2a, I will proceed. (I say this only so that people will
understand the context in which I personally use the word most 
commonly.  I am willing to discuss the idea in other contexts if
they are provided for me in advance.)

>To begin debate, let's consider a policy that is set by the imps
>on the Five Worlds MUD.  Five Worlds' server is within the Boston
>University network domain (anybody can play by telnetting to
