>The Five Worlds' censorship policy is available to any player who types
>"help plug":
>
>> help plug
>> ADVERTISING PLUG
>> 
>> If you advertise for another mud you will be dealt with harshly.
>> Up to and including being brutally slayed..depending on who catches you.
>> 
>> You have been warned.
>
Is this a censorship policy?  Which definition of censorship would you
use, and how do you think that it applies?

[...]
