civil-rights grounds and ended up reading ALL that repulsive material:

Dennis Miller on SNL commenting on "Nasty As They Wanna Be", the banned
album by 2Live Crew said: "Hey, I'm all for civil rights, guys, but what
makes me mad is that the controversy made me listen to the thing, and
believe me, this was ONE BAD ALBUM, really bad.  Couldn't we have gone
